  {
    "article_id": "10a26915-613b-4d5a-8211-cf35ef67b75c",
    "feature_area": "Smart Tips",
    "rationale": "The article needs an update to reflect that domain validation is now supported in Validation Smart Tips. This requires adding domain validation to the list of use cases and as a new row in the validation rules table.",
    "confidence": "high",
    "status": "approved",
    "proposed_html_content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" translate=\"no\" data-snippet=\"ST_MultiSegmentCallout\" class=\"fr-deletable\" id=\"blocksnippet\">{{snippet.ST_MultiSegmentCallout}}</div><h2 data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-001\" id=\"overview\">Overview</h2><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-002\">Whatfix enables you to use Validation Smart Tips to verify end user's inputs on your application. Whatfix enables you to set a valid input and evaluate your end user's response in a particular field of your application. If your end user input does not match the set data, then Whatfix displays an error message. Validation Smart Tips ensure that the end user input on forms can be validated, thus avoiding errors before form submission.</p><blockquote data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-003\" class=\"infoBox\" data-background=\"#ddf7ff\" data-border=\"#006a8a\" style=\"background:rgb(221, 247, 255);border-left:4px solid rgb(0, 106, 138);overflow:auto;\"><div class=\"blockquote-title\"><p>Info:</p></div><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-004\">Validation Smart Tips can be used with or without a Help Tip.</p></blockquote><h2 data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-005\" id=\"use-cases\">Use Cases</h2><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-006\">Use validation tip to:</p><ul data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-007\" data-list-format=\"disc\"><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-008\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-009\">Evaluate whether the end user has filled mandatory fields in a form correctly or not.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-010\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-011\">Check if dates are put in a set valid date format, for example, dd/mm/yyyy.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-012\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-013\">Check if valid entries are made in a numeric field.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-014\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-015\">Check if the end user had put a valid 10-digit number in the phone number field.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-016\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-017\">Check if an email, domain, or web address is put in a valid format.</p></li></ul><h2 data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-018\" id=\"create-a-validation-smart-tip-collection\">Create a Validation Smart Tip Collection</h2><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-019\">Use the following steps to add data validation using Smart Tips:</p><div contenteditable=\"false\" translate=\"no\" data-snippet=\"create_smart_tip\" class=\"fr-deletable\" id=\"blocksnippet\">{{snippet.create_smart_tip}}</div><ol data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-020\" start=\"5\" data-list-format=\"decimal\" style=\"--start:4;\"><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-021\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-022\">Click <strong>+ Add validation tip</strong>.<br type=\"inline\"><img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-023\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/2024-10-18_14-36-02%281%29.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"Studio_validationtip\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" dataalign=\"left\" datadisplay=\"flex\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"false\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\" link=\"\" newtab=\"\" style=\"height:auto;\"></p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-024\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-025\">Select an element on the application that you would like to add the validation to.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-026\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-027\">In the <strong>Display validation rules</strong> section, click the <strong>+ Add Rule</strong> button.<br type=\"inline\"><img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-028\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/2024-10-18_14-37-09.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"Studio_Displayrules\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" dataalign=\"left\" datadisplay=\"flex\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"false\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\" link=\"\" newtab=\"\" style=\"height:auto;\"></p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-029\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-030\">To add multiple rules, click the <strong>+ Add Rule</strong> button.<br type=\"inline\"><img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-031\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/2024-10-18_14-38-18.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"2024-10-18_14-38-18.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" dataalign=\"left\" datadisplay=\"flex\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"false\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\" link=\"\" newtab=\"\" style=\"height:auto;\"></p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-032\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-033\">Click <strong>Save Tip</strong>.<br type=\"inline\"><img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-034\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/2024-10-18_14-39-54.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"Studio_savetip\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" dataalign=\"left\" datadisplay=\"flex\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"false\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\" link=\"\" newtab=\"\" style=\"height:auto;\"></p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-035\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-036\">To add additional data validations, repeat steps 4 to 9.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-037\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-038\">After all the data validation tips are created, click the <strong>Save Tip</strong> button.<br type=\"inline\"><img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-039\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/2024-10-18_14-28-50%281%29.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"Studio_savetip\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" dataalign=\"left\" datadisplay=\"flex\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"false\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\" link=\"\" newtab=\"\" style=\"height:auto;\"></p></li></ol><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-040\">The following table lists the validation rules and their description:</p><div data-type=\"table-content\"><table width=\"975\" class=\"editor360-table\" borderstyle=\"solid\" style=\"max-width:975px;width:975px;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:487px;\"><col style=\"width:488px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-041\"><strong>Rule</strong></p></th><th colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-042\"><strong>Description</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-043\"><strong>Numeric</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-044\">Validates whether the user input is numeric or not.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-045\"><strong>Character Length</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-046\">Validates the user input based on the set minimum or maximum character length.<br type=\"inline\"><br type=\"inline\"><img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-047\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/image-WB2VCCNJ.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"\" dataalign=\"center\" datadisplay=\"inline\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"true\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\"></p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-048\"><strong>Email Address</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-049\">Validates whether the user input is in an email address format or not.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-050\"><strong>Domain</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-051\">Validates whether the user input is in a domain format or not.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-052\"><strong>Web Address</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-053\">Validates whether the user input is in a web address format or not.</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"487px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-054\"><strong>Date Format</strong></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" colwidth=\"488px\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-055\">Validates the user input based on the set date format. <img data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-056\" src=\"https://cdn.document360.io/a268766e-d74d-4619-9613-e2472f809ffb/Images/Documentation/2024-10-18_14-42-18.png?sv=2026-02-06&amp;spr=https&amp;st=2026-11-02T08%3A44%3A38Z&amp;se=2026-11-02T08%3A59%3A38Z&amp;sr=c&amp;sp=r&amp;sig=jqhy8voLBoZPpWNc%2BXUGOWDWyPCCx3SRI1Td2bLR4W0%3D\" class=\"adv-wysiwyg-img\" mediatype=\"img\" alt=\"Displayrules\" width=\"500\" height=\"auto\" dataalign=\"left\" datadisplay=\"flex\" data-type=\"media-content\" fixaspectratio=\"false\" autoaspectratio=\"false\" shadow=\"no\" border=\"no\" round=\"no\" link=\"\" newtab=\"\" style=\"height:auto;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><blockquote data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-057\" class=\"warningBox\" data-background=\"#fdf2ce\" data-border=\"#7f6416\" style=\"background:rgb(253, 242, 206);border-left:4px solid rgb(127, 100, 22);overflow:auto;\"><div class=\"blockquote-title\"><p>Note:</p></div><ul data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-058\" data-list-format=\"disc\"><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-059\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-060\">Whatfix does not capture and store any data during validation, instead Whatfix reads the text and evaluates it using the validation rules in real-time.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-061\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-062\">The validations can additionally have multiple rules with AND/OR conditions between them.<br type=\"inline\"> An error message is mandatory if validation rules are configured.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-063\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-064\">The validation does not work when no data is entered in the text box.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-065\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-066\">API validation within the scope of an iFrame is NOT supported.</p></li><li data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-067\"><p data-block-id=\"i2pagent-output-068\">Locale or language-based error message over-rides need to be handled in the code.</p></li></ul></blockquote>",
